  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/07/LlibrePintxoManaBar.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(17 fotos) El escritor Julio Garc&iacute;a Robles ha presentado este jueves en Man&aacute; Bar de Onda su libro &Uacute;ltimo tren con destino al infierno, sobre el rock en la provincia de Castell&oacute;n, para conmemorar el d&iacute;a de esta m&uacute;sica, con pinchos de Hosturionda y el sonido del pub Swing de la mano de Jos&eacute; M&aacute;&ntilde;ez Sifre.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/llibreipintxomanabar/img_7274.jpg\" alt=\"img_7274\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/llibreipintxomanabar/img_7277.jpg\" alt=\"img_7277\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/llibreipintxomanabar/img_7279.jpg\" alt=\"img_7279\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/llibreipintxomanabar/img_7282.jpg\" alt=\"img_7282\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/llibreipintxomanabar/img_7290.jpg\" alt=\"img_7290\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/llibreipintxomanabar/img_7294.jpg\" alt=\"img_7294\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/llibreipintxomanabar/img_7296.jpg\" alt=\"img_7296\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/llibreipintxomanabar/img_7298.jpg\" alt=\"img_7298\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/llibreipintxomanabar/img_7299.jpg\" alt=\"img_7299\" styl